{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using pca_n2000 encoder, achieving validation accuracy of 0.4849 and F1 of 0.4639, lower than the multimodal baseline (0.5266 accuracy, 0.5104 F1). The results suggest RNA-only models with pca_n2000 may underperform compared to multimodal configurations, but the absence of image data and fusion strategies limits definitive conclusions about the value of multimodal integration. The effectiveness of pca_n2000 alone remains uncertain without further comparative benchmarks."
}

